<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This spot great for fishin’.\nSeein’ all them people fishin’,\fyou feelin’ like tryin’ it\ftoo?\rWant one of my Rods? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you wanna fish, face\nthe water and use the Rod.\rThen lock in and watch\nthe water close!\rWhen a “!” pop up, a homie\ngot on the line!\rSmash the A Button quick to\nreel it in.\rThen you’ll see what’s up.\rIf there’s water, ocean or\ncreek, throw that Rod in.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh. That’s kinda weak, bro...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you wanna fish, face\nthe water and use the Rod.\rThen lock in and watch\nthe water close!\rWhen a “!” pop up, a homie\ngot on the line!\rSmash the A Button quick to\nreel it in.\rThen you’ll see what’s up.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What should I make my homie hold?\rMaybe somethin’ that\npump up its Attack...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo.\nHow you doin’?\fYou pickin’ Apricorns? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayyy, lil Apricorn collector!\rI’m feelin’ so good, I wanna\nbless you with this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Why not? What a waste!\rI’ma show you how fire\nApricorns are!\rTake this first.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lure Ball!\nThis Hood Ball make it easy to\frecruit the homies that bite\fwhen you go fishin’!\rIt’s made outta Apricorns, by\nthe way. Take them two, on me.\rWant more? Go to Azalea Town.\nA man named Kurt make custom\fHood Balls outta Apricorns.\rApricorns run this!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0381_R32PC0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kurt is a legend to every\nApricorn collector out there.\rIf you headed to Azalea Town,\nmake sure you holla at him.\rApricorn, Apricorner, Apricornest!</language>
	</row>
</body>
